The arithmetic check confirms 496 out-of-range pairs each for EXT, DEXTM, and DEXTU, and none for DEXT. The reference calls those cases UNPREDICTABLE, so they have no specified result value. I’ll use decoder rejection as the proposed regression oracle; C also does not guarantee that an invalid shift count is masked.

